   For why we chose some of the numbers for things, each was caused by a certain reason. For example the 10 credits for spending your troops. The highest number card in the deck for Infantry 
was the 10, and since it could only be beaten by two cards those being itself and the Ace, we figured that playing that should cost the most, so it took all the credits for that round. 
The hand size was chosen to be 5 to line up with the battlefield size itself. Only drawing 3 cards was to balance things out a little bit. Originally when the field was that 2x3 area, 
we drew back up to a fill hand which was 3 at the time, we decided with the larger battlefield, we should limit how many cards can be drawn as to make it play differently and a bit more strategic.
